Description: ARIB STD-B25 decoder (decode-only on iOS)
 Built on-device. iOS ships the decode subcommand only and links
 libpcsclite (not PCSC.framework). Source is pinned to
 Khronos31/recisdb-rs (PR kazuki0824/recisdb-rs#188) until the next
 upstream release after that merge.
 .
 Pipe MPEG-TS into recisdb decode. Needs pcscd plus a reader
 (px4-userland IFD for the Q3U4 internal card).
